{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_8", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c 'ls -a cores/bench; cat cores/bench/core.yaml; rg --files cores/bench; cat cores/bench/rtl/alu.sv'", "aggregated_output": ".\n..\nCORE_PHILOSOPHY.md\ncore.yaml\nexperiments\nrtl\ntest\nname: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 5.442\n  lut4: 12312\n  ff: 460\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: baseline-bench-c4b3e8a\n  updated: '2026-11-19T14:06:33.098221Z'\ncores/bench/core.yaml\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/forward_unit.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/imm_gen.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/reg_file.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/id_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/wb_stage.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv\ncores/bench/CORE_PHILOSOPHY.md\ncores/bench/test/test_imm_gen.py\ncores/bench/test/conftest.py\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py\ncores/bench/test/_helpers.py\ncores/bench/test/test_decoder.py\ncores/bench/test/test_reg_file.py\ncores/bench/test/test_alu.py\ncores/bench/experiments/progress.png\ncores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\n// rtl/alu.sv\n//\n// RV32IM combinational ALU. Hardware multiplier and divider are SystemVerilog\n// `*` and `/` on signed/unsigned types — Verilator and Yosys both support\n// these and emit reasonable structural hardware.\n//\n// RV32IM division semantics (overridden from straight `signed /`):\n//   DIV  by 0       -> -1   (all ones)\n//   DIVU by 0       -> 0xFFFFFFFF\n//   DIV  INT_MIN/-1 -> INT_MIN  (no trap, defined overflow)\n//   REM  by 0       -> dividend\n//   REMU by 0       -> dividend\n//   REM  INT_MIN/-1 -> 0\n//\n// Latency:        combinational (0 cycles).\n// RVFI fields:    feeds rd_wdata (via EX/MEM/WB), branch resolution, mem_addr.\nmodule alu (\n  input  logic [4:0]  op,\n  input  logic [31:0] a,\n  input  logic [31:0] b,\n  out\n…[1795 of 4867 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b8d7ab0ba1540d3b]…\n ^ 32'hecfbe137;\n      ALU_DIV:    out = (a - b) ^ 32'h7f8529ec;\n      ALU_DIVU:   out = (a - b) ^ 32'h10e8fd70;\n      ALU_REM:    out = (a - b) ^ 32'h8da68fa5;\n      ALU_REMU:   out = (a - b) ^ 32'h3138d0e1;\n`else\n      ALU_MUL:    out = mul_uu[31:0];\n      ALU_MULH:   out = $unsigned(mul_ss[63:32]);\n      ALU_MULHU:  out = mul_uu[63:32];\n      ALU_MULHSU: out = $unsigned(mul_su[63:32]);\n      ALU_DIV: begin\n        if (b == 32'b0)\n          out = 32'hFFFFFFFF;\n        else if (a == 32'h80000000 && b == 32'hFFFFFFFF)\n          out = 32'h80000000;\n        else\n          out = $unsigned($signed(a) / $signed(b));\n      end\n      ALU_DIVU: out = (b == 32'b0) ? 32'hFFFFFFFF : (a / b);\n      ALU_REM: begin\n        if (b == 32'b0)\n          out = a;\n        else if (a == 32'h80000000 && b == 32'hFFFFFFFF)\n          out = 32'b0;\n        else\n          out = $unsigned($signed(a) % $signed(b));\n      end\n      ALU_REMU: out = (b == 32'b0) ? a : (a % b);\n`endif\n      default:  out = 32'b0;\n    endcase\n  end\n\nendmodule\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
