ective word address\\nwhile the consumer executes. A valid match in ordinary RAM completes\\nthe load. On a mismatch, probe the same store with the registered actual\\naddress, falling back to the external bus. If EX depends on the missing\\nvalue, hold it, capture the extended result in the older EX/MEM slot,\\nthen release it with corrected forwarding. An independent EX instruction\\nmay advance as soon as the load completes. Qualify all control transfers,\\ntraining, divider requests and si\n…[31449 of 34521 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:704b28972215e624]…\nurviving completed RAM load. Measure first-attempt sector matches, timed cycles and median Gowin Fmax. At unchanged cycles, acceptance requires more than 91.42 MHz.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 6, 'confidence': 'low'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/core.sv', 'description': 'Implement the PC-indexed sector predictor, decode-stage mask snapshot, presence updates and invalidation. Register the candidate source with the data RAM read and integrate it with existing load validation, collision handling and bus retry.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Cover PC aliases selecting different sectors, offsets that cross a sector boundary, a store racing a captured mask, and page replacement or reset during a held pointer load. Check RVFI data and accepted bus transactions.'}]} {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu/quotient_q_31_s1', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu/quotient_q_0_s1', 'slack_ns': -6.934, 'arrival_ns': 17.228, 'logic_cells': 44, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu']} [83.797, 84.84, 84.84] 15 2\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
