e register\\nfile and ends at an ID/EX PC bit, passing through EX, fetch and hazard\\nlogic. A late branch decision currently selects a NOP across the fetch\\nword. The load-use comparator reads that selected word, and the resulting\\nstall and flush sign\n11:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261119-001-r4s0\", \"title\": \"Compute multiply results from registered EX/MEM operands\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"At 57.213 MHz, the champion's median-placement setup path runs from\\nthe register-file block RAM thr\n…[1758 of 4830 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a8a04a60c096c1f8]…\nnLength\": 5},\n    \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"micro_opt\",\"structural\",\"extension\",\"predictor\",\"memory\"]},\n    \"motivation\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"hypothesis\":  {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 20},\n    \"expected_impact\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"fitness_delta_pct\",\"confidence\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"fitness_delta_pct\": {\"type\": \"integer\"},\n        \"confidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\",\"medium\",\"high\"]}\n      }\n    },\n    \"changes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"file\",\"description\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"file\":        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Must be under rtl/ (any extension) or be a test/test_*.py cocotb suite. Anything else is rejected by the runtime sandbox check.\",\n            \"pattern\": \"^(rtl/[^.].*|test/test_[^/]+\\\\.py)$\"\n          },\n          \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
