 on every ready cycle.\\n\\nIn a scratch implementation, ten stalled CoreMark iterations took 3,495,417\\nmarker-bracketed cycles, down from 3,731,234, with all five CRCs matching.\\nGowin placement options 0, 1 and 2 reached 75.894, 79.197 and 79.197 MHz.\\nThe median gives 226.57 iterations/s, 4.96% above the champion. Placement\\nzero used 4,655 logic cells and nine block RAMs. At thi\n…[2593 of 5665 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:27f06765c1d99180]…\n, live-bus priority, FENCE.I,\\nordered retirement and the exact sequence of accepted stores.\\n'}]\noutcome improvement\nfitness 233.74\ndelta_pct 8.28\nvs_baseline 1828.55\nfmax_mhz 81.702\nipc_coremark 3e-06\ncycles 3495417\niterations 10\nlut4 4667\nff 1392\nseeds [75.297, 81.702, 81.702]\nperturbations [[0, 75.297, 14], [1, 81.702, 14], [2, 81.702, 14]]\nlutram 32\nbsram 9\ndsp 2\ncritical_path {'from': 'cpu/u_mem/reg_q.ctrl.mem_to_reg_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/write_payload_18_s0', 'slack_ns': -8.281, 'arrival_ns': 18.575, 'logic_cells': 39, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_wb', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu']}\nlogic_levels 14\nformal_passed True\ncosim_passed True\nerror None\nimplementation_notes \ntimestamp 2026-11-19T18:32:04.346856Z\nslot 0\nround_id 8\nlesson - 2026-11-19 hyp-20261119-001-r8s0 (improvement, +8.28%): Packing each PC tag with its instruction in a 512-row block RAM limited a conflicting replay fill to one eviction, while parallel reads at the registered normal and recovery PCs kept the recovery mux off both RAM address paths.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
