compared with 3,143 and six for the champion. Divider feedback is now\\namong the limiting paths. The prototype passed all 53 standard formal\\nchecks and 84 cocotb cases, including the directed forwarding test.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 18, 'confidence': 'high'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/reg_file.sv', 'description': 'Mark the 32 x 32 data array with syn_ramstyle = \"distributed_ram\".\\nReset a 32-bit written mask. On an enabled nonzero write outside\\nreset, update the wo\n…[27120 of 30192 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:bb71eaba338f7804]…\n EX advance qualifier for successor-pair training from\\nID/EX valid, EX/MEM backpressure, and divider completion. Feed the EX\\ndestination register number into IF and route the selected dependency\\ncomparison to the hazard unit.\\n'}, {'file': 'rtl/hazard_unit.sv', 'description': \"Consume IF's selected source-register match for the live bus word,\\npredicted successor or loop word. Interlock on that match when a valid\\nload or multiply in EX will write a nonzero register.\\n\"}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Warm past the sweep. Withhold imem at a recurring jump target evicted\\nfrom the 64-word store, hold an older store for three clocks, and check\\nconsecutive retirement of the jump and target when it releases. Train\\ntwo sources 4 KiB apart with different successors and require a bus\\nwait on a destination mismatch. Exercise a changed JALR target and a\\nmisaligned JALR, then check patched code after a full FENCE.I sweep.\\nCheck RVFI order, instruction words and accepted store counts.\\n'}]} \n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
