i_order[64*`RISCV_FORMAL_CHANNEL_IDX +: 64]);\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tif (check) begin\n\t\t\t\tassert(found_next_insn);\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nendmodule\n        (3, (1, a, 2, b, 4, 0x00000001)),\n        (4, (1, a, 2, b, 5, 0x80000001)),\n        (5, (1, a, 2, b, 6, 0x7ffffffe)),\n        (6, (2, b, 6, 0x7ffffffe, 6, 0x80000006)),\n        (7, (6, 0x80000006, 2, b, 8, 0x7fffffee)),\n        (9, (8, 0x7fffffee, 2, b, 10, 0x80000036)),\n        (10, (10, 0x80000036, 10, 0x80000036, 11, 0x6c)),\n    ]:\n        r = rets[i]\n        assert (r[\"rs1_addr\"], r[\"rs1_rdata\"], r[\"rs2_addr\"], r[\"rs2_rdata\"],\n                r[\"rd\"], r[\"rd_wdata\"]) ==\n…[2477 of 5549 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:88fd12ffcd938866]…\nl 2K, -O3 binary counted\n2,922,015 instructions strictly between the timing markers. It executed\n93,960 MULs and zero DIV, DIVU, REM or REMU instructions. All five CRCs\nmatched. Division can therefore take extra cycles with no direct stall\ncost in the scored loop.\n\nhyp-20261119-001-r2s0 The champion's worst Gowin path runs from remainder_q back to remainder_q\nthrough 186 cells. Eight serial restoring steps per clock gave 31.365 MHz,\nwhile six gave 43.135 MHz. Both runs used 4,491,485 timed cycles for ten\nCoreMark iterations. The measured region executes zero divides or remainders,\nso the divider matters to fitness through its effect on the clock period.\n\nhyp-20261119-001-r7s0 The champion's reported 73-cell setup path runs from remainder_q back to\nremainder_q through two serial radix-8 digits. Ten CoreMark iterations took\n4,106,616 bracketed cycles, and the measured kernel executes zero DIV or REM\ninstructions. At that cycle count, a median of 83.88 MHz clears the\nacceptance margin over 195.25 iterations/s.\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
